    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
        <div class="faq-inner">
            <div class="section-label" style="text-align:center">FAQ</div>
            <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;max-width:100%">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p class="section-desc" style="text-align:center;max-width:100%;margin-bottom:40px">Everything you need to know about NMB-HLabSys.</p>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    How do I register as a patient?
                    <div class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19" /><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /></svg></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>Click the <strong>Register</strong> button on this page or in the navigation bar. Fill in your personal details including your SA ID number, date of birth, cellphone number and home address. Once submitted, you can log in immediately.</p></div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    How do I view my lab results?
                    <div class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19" /><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /></svg></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>After logging in to your Patient portal, navigate to <strong>My Results</strong> in the sidebar. Results are only visible once your doctor has reviewed and released them to you.</p></div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    Is my personal and medical data secure?
                    <div class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19" /><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /></svg></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. All passwords are encrypted using BCrypt hashing. Access is fully role-based — meaning users can only see data relevant to their role. All actions are logged in an audit trail.</p></div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    What do I do if I forget my password?
                    <div class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19" /><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /></svg></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>On the login page, click <strong>Forgot Password</strong>. Enter your registered email address and a reset link will be sent to you. The link expires after a set period for security.</p></div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    Can I download my results as a PDF?
                    <div class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19" /><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /></svg></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Once your results are released, you will find a <strong>Download PDF</strong> button on your results page. The PDF includes your full result report with reference ranges and any flagged abnormalities.</p></div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
